  - architecture `contract/wrapper-event-appends/launch` — «once at every start» becomes «once at every start and once
    at every switch», PROVISIONAL (delegate overseer; pattern «Boundary widening», F1);
  - architecture `contract/channel-methods` — a `switch` row, and `contract/cli-verbs` — a `switch` row;
