  - security-plan — a `decision/switch-ends-only-its-own-child` row, PROVISIONAL (F1);
  - a11y-plan — a `RESPAWN_REAP_BOUND` row of its own beside the two «Eight time bounds» rows, which are not grown
    (`inputs#I1`);
  - design-system `contract/help-output/verb-groups` and `contract/viola-help/verb-groups`, layout-templates
