- **Counts / qualifiers moved:**
  - the wrapper channel's served methods: 9 → 10 requests (`switch`), with `hook.event` the one notification —
    `crates/viola-channel/src/server.rs` `METHODS` `[&str; 10]` → `[&str; 11]`, `tests/contract_error_bodies.rs`
    `CHANNEL_METHODS` `[&str; 10]` → `[&str; 11]` («The ten served methods and the one notification»);
  - `viola --help`'s `setup:` row: `open, run, revive, adopt, up, switch, verify, plugin install` (the `HELP` literal and
    `help_lists_only_served_verbs`' served list, 17 → 18 verbs);
  - `tests/cross_exit_causes.rs` `REFUSALS`: 1 → 5 rows (`dialog-pending`, `no-session`, `child-not-ended`,
    `resume-failed`, each exit 13);
  - `tests/contract_error_bodies.rs` `CLI_DOCUMENTS`: +3 rows for `src/cmd/switch.rs` (`human-typing` 10,
    `unverified-cli` 12, `not-delivered` 13);
  - `send_hint`'s causes: +4 (`dialog-pending`, `no-session`, `child-not-ended`, `resume-failed`);
  - the time bounds: +1, `RESPAWN_REAP_BOUND` 10 s (a row of its own, F6).

- Acceptance, re-asserted against the diff:
  - idle switch exit 0, the human line, wrapper pid unchanged, argv carries `--resume <id> --model M --effort E` (read
    from `/proc`), one `launch {M, E}` and one `session-start` `resume` of the same id from the switch's offset — MET by
    `switch_of_an_idle_session_resumes_it_on_the_new_pair` (the fake agent);
  - user config and settings byte- and mtime-equal, no `--settings` — MET by
    `switch_keeps_the_user_settings_byte_and_mtime_equal` (the test-owned user home);
  - revive with no pair resumes on the switched pair — MET by `switch_then_revive_replays_the_switched_pair`;
  - the refusal order, the first rung winning, none appending or ending the child — MET by `switch_refusal_order_cases`
    and the three refusal cases of `tests/cli_switch.rs`, controls `sw-turn` and `sw-dialog` holding;
  - `launch` after the reap and before the respawn — MET by `switch_appends_launch_before_the_spawn`, control
    `sw-launch-first` holding;
  - a child not exited within `RESPAWN_REAP_BOUND` is not replaced, refused `child-not-ended` — MET at the seam by
    `respawn_of_a_child_ignoring_the_signal_reads_not_ended` (control `pty-reap-bound` holding) and at the method by
    `switch_respawn_outcomes_are_refusals::case_1_not_ended`;
  - `viola --help` lists `switch` in `setup:` after `up` — MET by the `HELP` literal;
  - every new detail word in the schema — MET vacuously, no line emits one (Deviations); every new error body named,
    every new cause in the table, no hint naming `viola release` — MET (the readers' entry);
  - the three layers print `"ok":true` — MET; the operator pass's CI read — owed to the operator pass.
